# drizzle
# Migrations AND drizzle/meta/ MUST be committed. The migrations are the only
# reproducible record of the schema (ignoring them is how has_pdf/pdf_path
# shipped as a hand-applied ALTER TABLE that existed on exactly one machine),
# and meta/ holds the snapshot that makes `drizzle-kit generate` incremental --
# without it, generate re-emits a full CREATE TABLE baseline every time.
# Nothing under drizzle/ is ignored.
